    "event": "pull_request",
    "head_branch": "feature/spec-39-step-10b-work-follows-change",
    "head_commit_message": "perf(sim): tend, the roster, word lookups and seeded sorts follow change (spec 39 step 10b-i)\n\nTend builds no unit's record when no body lies. Tend, stamina, recovery and\ncarry code the words they read once a pass instead of once a unit. A\nrelisting keeps each squad whose living are unchanged and moves the roster\nrather than copying it. The sorts on a seeded draw take each key once.\nOutcomes are unchanged. 10b is split into 10b-i to 10b-iii in the spec.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011AyPi1cU4fEj5sBg1ahCvE",
